        "text": "=Break the following project into a concise roadmap and a list of concrete, assignable tasks.\n\nProject Title: {{ $json.project_title }}\nCategory: {{ $json.category }}\nPriority: {{ $json.priority }}\nSummary: {{ $json.summary }}\n\nGenerate 3-7 tasks. Assign each to the most appropriate department and estimate its duration in days.",
